              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Buying on Suction Instead of Obstacle Avoidance</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">
                The robot that eats a charging cable gets run manually forever after, and at that point it has stopped saving you anything. Obstacle avoidance is the strongest predictor of whether a robot stays in daily use, and it is where premium money is most clearly justified.
